      "en": "He said, “Throw it on the ground.” He threw it on the ground, and it became a snake; and Moses ran away from it.",
      "ko": "여호와께서 가라사대 그것을 땅에 던지라 곧 땅에 던지니 그것이 뱀이 된지라 모세가 뱀 앞에서 피하매",
      "source_text_hash": "c662c254a9fffbc831eb0cfae93430c3e517a50c07e98c5446961c97ac9eccb2",
      "translation_text_hash": "a09720ff8e1a44864e6a6a653069c135c4d1e518356fef327f8594a77862689e",
