      "en": "Now therefore go, and I will be with your mouth, and teach you what you shall speak.”",
      "ko": "이제 가라 내가 네 입과 함께 있어서 할 말을 가르치리라",
      "source_text_hash": "920e41302245d2691fe1ddd69a0fb1c8af4f39085a3e56f08ff5e049716bb73b",
