      ],
      "en": "The LORD said to Moses in Midian, “Go, return into Egypt; for all the men who sought your life are dead.”",
      "ko": "여호와께서 미디안에서 모세에게 이르시되 애굽으로 돌아가라 네 생명을 찾던 자가 다 죽었느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "b3b7e6741768a6538ee8522d811655bda1df14ee49e23694b82bcd6e1c16152d",
      "translation_text_hash": "4415126b9d78d4b672d35ab8ee9520a70bbd4dbf2d4bbdaa0f593d600b545969",
